{
  "description": "A single four-legged, shaggy-coated creature is shown in left-facing profile against a plain off-white background, standing in a walking pose. The body is that of a goat, covered in long, coarse brown fur that is darker on the back and legs and lighter cream on the belly, with a goat-like head at the front left and a short bushy tail at the rear right. A large, domed, hard tortoise shell with raised pyramidal scutes in brown, tan and dark brown covers the entire mid-back from behind the shoulders to over the hips, with fur visible around its lower edge where it meets the body. The creature has two curved horns on its head, pointed ears, a beard under its chin, and four legs ending in cloven hooves.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "goat-like head at the front left facing left, with an elongated muzzle, dark nose and nostril, closed mouth, a visible light brown eye with dark pupil and dark tear-line, and a tuft of longer hair forming a beard hanging from the chin and lower jaw, covered in shaggy brown fur",
      "where": "at the extreme front of the body, attached to the neck"
    },
    {
      "part": "horns",
      "looks_like": "two thick, ridged, brown keratin horns with visible growth rings, curving backward and then outward to a pointed tip",
      "where": "on top of the head behind the ears"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two small, pointed, furry ears with visible inner ear detail, brown on the outside and lighter inside",
      "where": "on the sides of the head just behind and below the horns"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "long, shaggy, coarse brown fur, thicker and longer along the underside of the neck and chest forming a mane-like ruff, and shorter but still shaggy over the body and legs, with a paler cream-white patch on the belly and flank",
      "where": "covering the neck, chest, body, and legs, longest on the neck, chest, and tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four sturdy, straight, shaggy brown legs with visible joints and furry covering down to the hooves, in a walking stance with left legs slightly forward",
      "where": "two front legs under the chest and two hind legs under the hips, supporting the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four cloven hooves, each split into two toes with dark gray-brown keratin and a slightly lighter tip, with furry pasterns just above",
      "where": "at the bottom end of each leg touching the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "short, bushy, shaggy tail made of long brown hair with a lighter patch at the base, hanging down slightly",
      "where": "at the far right rear of the body above the hind legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "shell",
      "looks_like": "large, domed, hard shell with a high arch and steep sides, composed of many polygonal scutes each with a raised pyramidal keel and concentric striated growth lines in shades of brown, tan, yellowish and dark brown with light borders",
      "where": "covering the entire dorsal mid-back from just behind the shoulders to just in front of the tail, sitting on top of the fur"
    },
    {
      "part": "plates",
      "looks_like": "individual geometric scutes/plates that make up the shell, each roughly diamond or hexagonal with a pointed center and radiating ridges, arranged in longitudinal rows",
      "where": "tiled across the surface of the shell on the back"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "goat",
    "tortoise"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 0,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0,
  "tails": 1
}
